ure,  and when the heat source temperature meets a When the temperature condition is preset,  a rotation signal is generated according to the position of the heat source;  A camera module,  connected to the transmission module,  captures an environmental monitoring image according to the abnormal air quality signal;  A rotating module,  which connects the camera module and the thermal sensing module,  drives the camera module to rotate according to the rotation signal so that the heat source is located in a heat source monitoring area of the environmental monitoring image,  and makes the camera module Acquiring the environmental monitoring image by targeting the heat source;  A human figure recognition module,  connected to the camera module,  determines that at least Whether a part meets a preset humanoid condition;  and A smoke warning module,  connected to the thermal sensing module and the human figure recognition module,  when the thermal sensing module senses that the temperature of the heat source meets the preset temperature condition and the human figure recognition module judges the environmental monitoring image A smoking warning is generated when at least a part of them meets the preset humanoid condition;  and A server unit,  connected to the image unit,  receives the smoking warning,  the environmental monitoring image and the air quality information sent by the image unit,  and generates an evidence search image.

