The present invention relates to the technical field of machine vision,  and specifically discloses a method for identifying pipeline work behavior based on machine vision,  wherein the method comprises :  acquiring pipeline image information in real time; Determining a production line material area and a production line working area of the production line image information according to the preset configuration information; Performing tracking detection on a human-shaped target located in a production line working area of the production line image information,  to obtain motion trail and attitude information of the human-shaped target; Detecting materials located in a pipeline material area of the pipeline image information to obtain material types and material position information; Comprehensive analysis is performed according to the motion trail and attitude information of the human-shaped target,  the material type and material position information and a preset process standard library to determine the working behavior of the production line working area. The human-shaped target motion trail and attitude information of the human-shaped target,  the material type and material position information of the human-shaped target,  and the preset process standard library of the human-shaped target are analyzed comprehensively. The invention can effectively improve the accuracy of the production line work behavior recognition based on machine vision. 1. A production line work behaviour identification method based on machine vision,  wherein it comprises :  obtaining the production line image information in real time;  determining the production line material area and the production line working area of the production line image information according to the preset configuration information;  tracking and detecting the human-shaped target in the production line working area of the production line image information to obtain the human-shaped target motion track and attitude information;  detecting the material in the production line material area of the production line image information to obtain the material type and material position information;  according to the human-shaped target motion track and attitude information,  material type and material position information and preset process standard library for comprehensive analysis,  determining the working behaviour of the production line working area;  tracking and detecting the human-shaped target located in the pipeline working area of the pipeline image information,  so as to obtain the human-shaped target motion track and attitude information,  comprising :  performing target detection on the pipeline image information to determine a humanoid target in a pipeline working area;  tracking the human-shaped target to determine the motion track of the human-shaped target;  analyzing and identifying the current action of the human-shaped target to determine the gesture information of the human-shaped target;  detecting the material in the production line material area of the production line image information,  obtaining the material type and material position information,  comprising :  inputting the production line image information to a material detection model to obtain a material detection result,  wherein the material detection model is obtained by inputting the production line material data to a target detection algorithm for training;  determining the material number in the material detection result and determining the material type according to the material classification model;  matching the current target material with the target material in the former frame according to the material number and the material type so as to determine the material tracking information;  determining the material position information according to the material tracking information;  according to the movement track and attitude information of the human-shaped target,  the material type and material position information and the preset process standard library for comprehensive analysis,  determining the working behaviour of the pipeline working area,  comprising :  according to the production line work type fitting model,  performing fitting identification on the human-shaped target,  so as to determine the human-shaped target work type information;  classifying the work of the human-shaped target according to the human-shaped target work type information and the human-shaped target movement track and posture information so as to determine the work behaviour of the human-shaped target;  according to the material number,  material type and material position information and the working behaviour of the human-shaped target to correlate,  obtaining the correlation result of the human-shaped target;  according to the correlation result of the human shape target,  performing similarity matching with the preset process standard library,  so as to determine the process type corresponding to the working behaviour of the human shape target,  the preset process standard library comprises the characteristic,  behaviour mode and time sequence information of different processes.

